    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Hernan Eslava",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104571786631425198706/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI7GnXbali-g38Zz8ZFoExsoe_gfKduJuPxhqWtoLgw_Inwhg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Brought a Mercedes a couple of weeks ago for a repair as part of one of Desjardins recommended body shops. Excellent customer service, from the receptionist to the general manager. Very pleasant to deal with them.\nThey do what they have to do and they don't cut corners.\nConsidering how difficult is to get a decent customer service these days it is good to see there are companies out there that strive to provide a good customer experience",
        "time": 1575602997,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Honest Opinion",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111679340897733596750/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL1oMDHIQHqPfs2WF9s10UOrllDMS_700HuS9JOTD_lWaZVXw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Amazing!\nHad unfortunately experienced my 1 st real accident and it was a big one. It was my brand new high end vehicle and I was heart broken.\nFrom the moment I called to the moment I picked it back up, I must say my faith was restored in \"service a la clientele\".\nThey always answered the phone, ALWAYS super friendly, super polite, super respectful and accommodated my preferred language.\nThey did more for me in 2 months then my dealership has ever done in 2 years.\nMy hat is off to everyone at procolor st lazare!!!\nThank you so much again!!!",
        "time": 1649420708,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Arch V",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116281029640911835690/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXxQlP1L57SIvIac8mIqhqpC2jMWS_QSYsp8qYgAbU3NXy_PzU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "I had work done on my truck this year, I can’t tell you enough how helpfully the staff was, they answered all questions kept me informed every step of the way. Extremely fair and honest people. If you ever need anything done look no further. Great people, great family owned business.",
        "time": 1565392904,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Carl Cloutier",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110532707323527512998/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLhRBeCglXeHTgSPMbfGcbaXbLNhyZquWJOTxsBeiYK7cStcA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Fantastic service, unfortunately had to bring my car twice in six month and both time I had very very good service, everyone is very nice and they take the time to fix every single problem that my car had due to the accidents. Very happy with all the work they have done and I recommend them 100%",
        "time": 1592394178,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Andrea Ballara",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115916202754147480660/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWRumKv-ZUAmY9ux2kaw3CQDX2B8n8QgFGY8mbXAdbBze8qFv40=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Nice people, worst service ever! Once I gave my car in for body repair after an accident ( Remorques St-Lazare dropping my car!) I did not hear from them, no update, nothing. After 1 1/2 week I called to see what was going on. \"Your car will be ready today\", they said. I went to pick it up, the repair was not complete. Never going there again! Oh, but they will clean your car really well. Maybe they should be a carwash......",
        "time": 1621285459,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
